    <div class="section-label">Act I — The Context Explosion</div>
    <h1 class="headline">Why Context Has a<br>Weight Problem</h1>
    <div class="two-col" style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <div>
        <div class="col-label">Infrastructure</div>
        <div class="col-item">KV Cache — memory scales quadratically with sequence length</div>
        <div class="col-item">Vector DBs — compression degrades similarity scores</div>
        <div class="col-item">On-Device — mobile models can't hold enterprise context</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="col-label" style="color:{TOKENS['red']}">The Hidden Cost</div>
        <div class="col-item active">AI Search Agents — every traversal step is a KV cache read. Context loss = worse answers</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">"When an AI agent loses context halfway through reasoning about your content, it doesn't tell you. It just gives a worse answer."</div>
    """
